OL,3,GNEWSABabydoll singer lands
OL,4,Alongest-running UK number one by Welsh
OL,5,Aartist in 56 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FJamie Miller's Babydoll has become the
OL,8,Flongest-running UK number one single by
OL,9,Fa Welsh artist in 56 years.
OL,11,FMiller, who is originally from
OL,12,FPontprennau in Cardiff, claimed the top
OL,13,Fspot with his TikTok-viral hit for the
OL,14,Fsixth consecutive week on Friday.
OL,16,FThe 29-year-old star's success is equal
OL,17,Fto the six-week streak set by Dave
OL,18,FEdmunds' I Hear You Knocking back in
OL,19,F1970.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
