OL,3,GNEWSABabydoll singer lands
OL,4,Alongest-running UK number one by Welsh
OL,5,Aartist in 56 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FBabydoll was released on 7 August -
OL,8,Fjust months after Miller considered
OL,9,Fquitting music - and exploded after
OL,10,Factress Jennifer Love Hewitt and other
OL,11,Fstars posted videos which featured the
OL,12,Ftrack.
